flowchart TB
  CA[Ciphertext Availability] --> DKA[Dispute-Key Availability]
  VSR[Valid-Share Readiness] --> AD[Authorized Decryptability]
  AKR[Authorized Key Release] --> AD
  AD --> DKA
  DDL[Dispute-Deadline Liveness] --> DKA
  PAC[Public Accountability] -. detects and attributes failures .-> DKA
  N1[CA does not imply DKA] -.-> CA
  N2[PVSS correctness does not imply deadline response] -.-> VSR
  L[Sampling is conditional evidence, not unconditional future proof] -.-> DKA
